  m_text: "\t5.1 How to Exercise Your Rights\r\n\rFor Data Deletion Requests:\r\n1.
    Email us at: Info@indiexrgames.com with subject \"Data Deletion Request\"\r\n2.
    Include your platform username and device information\r\n3. We will process your
    request within 30 days\r\n4. This includes deletion of:\r\n   - All locally stored
    game data\r\n   - Cloud-saved progress and settings\r\n   - Analytics data and
    usage history\r\n   - Platform-integrated data (achievements, social connections)\r\n  
    - Any data shared with third-party services"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4b05199e8c32aae40b24737b2018e978, type: 2}
