  m_text: "11. Platform-Specific Information\r\n\r\nSteam VR Users\r\n\u2013 Subject
    to Steam's Privacy Policy\r\n\u2013 Achievement data may be shared with Steam
    platform\r\n\r\nMeta/Oculus Users\r\n\u2013 Subject to Meta's Privacy Policy\r\n\u2013
    May integrate with Meta social features\r\n\u2013 Achievement and progress data
    may be synchronized with Meta services\r\n\u2013 Users can request deletion of
    all data including platform-integrated data\r\n\r\nOther VR Platforms\r\n\u2013
    Subject to respective platform privacy policies\r\n\u2013 Integration features
    may share limited data with platforms\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
