  m_text: "5. Your Rights and Choices\r\n\r\nYou have the right to:\r\n\u2013 Access:
    Request information about data we collect\r\n\u2013 Correction: Update or correct
    your information\r\n\u2013 Deletion: Request deletion of ALL your data (both
    local and remote)\r\n\u2013 Portability: Export your game data\r\n\u2013 Opt-out:
    Disable analytics and data collection (may affect functionality)"
