  m_text: "3. How We Use Your Information\r\nWe use collected information to:\r\n\u2013
    Provide and maintain the Game experience\r\n\u2013 Improve gameplay mechanics
    and performance\r\n\u2013 Fix bugs and technical issues\r\n\u2013 Analyze usage
    patterns to enhance game design\r\n\u2013 Provide customer support\r\n\u2013
    Ensure game security and prevent cheating\r\n\u2013 Enable platform features
    (achievements, social integration)"
